{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "TorZR9o00P", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Dan Rather (Republican National Convention in New York)", "segment_description": "NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen from 5:45:50 to 5:54:30.", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764427, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "dJFZQUd5By", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Hurricane Frances / Florida / Norcross Interview / Looting", "segment_description": "(New York: Dan Rather) Map shown of the projected path of Hurricane Frances. \n (Cocoa Beach, Florida: Mark Strassmann) Florida\u2019s preparations for the coming storm featured; details given of the mandatory evacuation order and the impact of another storm in the wake of Hurricane Charley; map shown. [Evacuees Rachel WILKERSON&#134;, Julia & Harold DAY&nbsp- react.] [Governor Jeb BUSH \u2013 says this is a deadly storm.] [Search organizer Beth ROSSMAN&#134;- comments on her job to warn people.] \n (New York: Dan Rather) Satellite views of Frances & Charley shown. Taped conversation held with WFOR-TV meteorologist Bryan Norcross about how Frances compares to other historic hurricanes; maps shown. [NORCROSS \u2013 talks about Hurricanes Andrew & Hugo in relation to Frances; predicts wind & rainfall amounts.] \n (West Palm Beach, Florida: Randall Pinkston) The risk for evacuees of having their property looted while they are gone featured; details given of widespread looting after 1992\u2019s Hurricane Andrew. [Trailer park owner Margie BELLAMY&#134;- shows the gun she will use to protect her property.] [Police OFFICER \u2013 says we don\u2019t want people to take the law into their own hands.] [Evacuee R.J. LEE \u2013 notes neighbors will be watching.]", "segment_duration": 390, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764428, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "7SeX19KSJl", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Tropical Storm Gaston / Virginia", "segment_description": "(New York: Dan Rather) The death toll in Virginia from sudden floods associated with Tropical Storm Gaston noted; scenes shown from Richmond.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63440.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764429, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "mS6iFdD3Qf", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Campaign 04 / Republican Convention / Kerry Attacks", "segment_description": "(New York: Dan Rather) President Bush\u2019s acceptance speech tonight at the Republican National Convention noted.   (Convention floor: John Roberts) How tonight\u2019s tone will differ from last night, when speakers Senator Zell Miller & Vice President Dick Cheney attacked Senator John Kerry, examined; Bush\u2019s speech tonight outlined; scene shown of Bush trying out the new stage at the convention center; details given on whether last night\u2019s criticisms of Kerry were accurate. [Bush campaign advisor Karen HUGHES&#134;- states Americans want a safe environment in which to rear their children.] [Last night, MILLER, CHENEY \u2013 criticize Kerry\u2019s voting record and his national security policy.] [In 1989, then-Defense Secretary CHENEY \u2013 urges budget cuts for military systems.] [At the Democratic National Convention, KERRY \u2013 says any attack will be met with a swift & certain response.] [Senior Kerry advisor Tad DEVINE&#134;- comments on the Republicans\u2019 strategy to destroy Kerry.]   (New York: Dan Rather) Tonight\u2019s coverage of the convention noted.", "segment_duration": 170, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63460.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764430, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "7JxwW9NTgj", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items; fallen hero Marine Cpl. Tyler Fey&#134<!-- spelling on screen --> profiled. (New York: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63630.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764431, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "XSaSF0M6tx", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Total; Minwax; Ecotrin; Viactiv; Scar Solution; Big Lots.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63680.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764432, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "4owUKmup3j", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Stock Market Report (New York: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63830.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764433, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "1pkUy6RAJF", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Inside Story (The Bush Promise: Medicare) Part IV", "segment_description": "(New York: Dan Rather) Special convention-week look at what has become of the promises made by President Bush during his 2000 presidential campaign continued. \n (New York: Mika Brzezinski) Bush\u2019s promise for Medicare reforms examined; scenes shown of Bush signing the prescription drug benefit bill in December, 2003; details given about the confusion & cost of the new plan. [At the Republican National Convention in August, 2000, BUSH \u2013 says we will make prescription drugs available & affordable for every senior.] [Seniors Judith KYLER\u2021, Gladys COLE\u2020- comment.] [Heritage Foundation Robert MOFFIT\u2020- says the cost of this thing is going to explode.] \n (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63840.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764434, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "UgWYU36Aru", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (New York: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63980.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764435, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "tVK1wnGkbu", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Ace Hardware; Poligrip; Capital One; Hyundai Sonata; Vioxx; Fresh Brush; \"CBS Evening News.\")", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 170, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "64000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764436, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "oCz7GmteoX", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Russia / School Standoff", "segment_description": "(New York: Dan Rather) Report introduced.   (Moscow: Elizabeth Palmer) The second night of the standoff in Beslan, Russia, where suspected radicals from nearby Chechnya are holding hostages at a school, featured; scenes shown of hostages that were released and of soldiers & relatives outside; animation shown of how the situation developed; details given of negotiations between the hostage-takers & Dr. Leonid Roshal\u2020\u2020 and of pressure on Russian President Vladimir Putin to do something.   (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64170.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764437, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "6zo7xCJRDQ", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Colorado / Bryant Rape Case", "segment_description": "(New York: Dan Rather) Announcement from a defense lawyer for basketball player Kobe Bryant that an apology {quoted} was part of deal to have rape charges dropped noted. \n (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64310.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764438, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-02", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764427, "segment_id": "rcNxw3izQp", "segment_broadcast_id": "nOPWpoiqe3", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (New York: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start